  "deep_rig_pole": {
    "name": "Deep Rig Pole",
    "use": "tool",
    "effect": "The weighted hand-line, and its own game rather than a longer cast: BAIT IT FIRST (a live snail, or any cut bait) or it will not leave the drum, then heave the lead over the side from anywhere that overlooks water. It plumbs straight down and the readout counts the metres — every species in fish.json only takes a bait that has reached its own drop_m, so the deeper the lead the deeper and bigger the pool (grouper at 16 m, sturgeon at 44). LMB thumbs the drum to hold a depth, a second LMB reels in. See FishingRod._deep."
  },
